    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PWD301 · Chapter 4 · Session 12</span>\n<h2>Session 12 — Chapter 4: Web Forms in Flask Applications</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14528 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PWD301 · Chương 4 · Buổi 12</span>\n<h2>Buổi 12 — Chapter 4: Web Forms in Flask Applications</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14528 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 4: Web Forms in Flask Applications<br>- Defining Form Classes: Creating form classes that inherit from FlaskForm; adding fields (StringField, PasswordField, TextAreaField, SelectField, BooleanField, SubmitField).<br>- Built-in Validators: DataRequired, InputRequired, Length, Email, NumberRange, EqualTo, Regexp<br>- Server-side validation and zero trust for user input</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Slide: Chapter 4<br>[Grinberg2018] Chapter 4: Web Forms<br>[Aggarwal2023] Chapter 5: Web Forms with WTForms</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read the materials beforehand, attend classes, and fulfill the instructor's requirements.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
